@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant "Map Editor" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : I want to build a station
    deactivate Player
    activate System

    System -> Player : Requests Inputs (coordinates and type of station)
    deactivate System
    activate Player

    Player -> System : Enters requested data
    deactivate Player
    activate System

    System -> Player : Output success message and updates the map

@enduml